WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.445
The project asks you to design a small analytics
layer for three needs Employee

00:00:06.471 --> 00:00:12.375
performance is stable shared logic and fits a
standard view Recent customer

00:00:12.401 --> 00:00:17.151
activity can be a shared view while the at-risk
threshold remains in a CTE because

00:00:17.177 --> 00:00:23.121
it may vary by report The diagnosis dashboard uses a
repeated summary

00:00:23.147 --> 00:00:26.700
and can use a materialized view when a refresh delay
is acceptable
